PATENT NOTICE

StackSpine has filed pending patent applications covering specific
implementation details of this gateway, including:

  1. "Pre-Request Budget Enforcement in a Multi-Model AI Routing System"
     — task-scoped, modality-aware (chat / embedding / image / voice) cost
       projection composed with route-strategy selection (canary / primary /
       fallback) and circuit-breaker state.

  2. "Compliance-Driven Route Filtering in a Multi-Model AI Control Plane"
     — deny-by-default policy evaluation that filters candidate routes
       before any payload is transmitted to a downstream provider, returning
       an empty-set compliance error rather than falling back to a
       non-compliant provider.

Budget enforcement and policy-based routing exist as broad concepts in
other AI gateway products. The pending claims above are directed to the
specific compositions and orderings described, not to the general ideas.

The Apache 2.0 patent grant (Section 3) applies to Contributions to this
repository. The pending patent rights described above are separate from
the Apache 2.0 grant and are not granted to non-contributors.

